[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_RESOURCES_DEVELOPMENT]
Resources Development

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_RESOURCES_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
Under the idea of “Acquiring Things We Probably Don’t Need”, our resources development policy will ensure that our nation’s steel, crystals, wood, rare metals, coal, rubber, and other valuable commodities are consistently produced and expertly hoarded away for a rainy day.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_RESOURCES_DEVELOPMENT]
资源开发

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_RESOURCES_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
在“获取东西，尽管我们可能并不需要”的指导理念下，我们的资源开发政策将确保我们国家的钢铁、水晶、木材、稀有金属、煤炭、橡胶和其他有价值的商品被可持续开发并熟练地储藏起来以备不时之需。
